<p>Individual "impact" events for each object within an Area of Effect.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Void%20keyword" title="Void keyword">void</a> SetIndividualImpactAOEEvent(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oCaster,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oTarget,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nAbility,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Location%20keyword" title="Location keyword">location</a> lTarget,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nBaseDelay&#160;= 0<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oCaster<dd>The person responsible for the area of effect<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oTarget<dd>The person who will run the effect<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nAbility<dd>The ability that should be cast<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">lTarget<dd>The location of the target of the event (used for fireball and other abilities that can be cast at the ground.<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nBaseDelay<dd>The base delay is 0 milliseconds; however, some cone effects require more than a random 150 millisecond delay to make crusts hit simultaneously with the cone.  Use BaseDelay for this purpose.
